  "body": "Property Documents can be downloaded here:  https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M6Z1\r\n\r\nOur vendor is heading to the South Island and needs to sell before she can make the move. If a private, easy-care home in Red Beach is on your list, now's the time to come and see this one.\r\nSet back up a right-of-way at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, this Mediterranean-style home feels tucked away from the moment you arrive. With brick construction, a concrete tile roof and a concrete foundation, it has a solid feel and a character of its own.\r\nInside, the open-plan living area is light and inviting, with new carpet, LED lighting and a heat pump for year-round comfort. The modernised kitchen has generous bench space, excellent storage and a gas cooktop. A ranch slider opens from the living area to a private courtyard, an easy spot to take your morning coffee outside.\r\nThe main bedroom looks across the courtyard, with a glimpse of the sea towards Whangaparaoa Peninsula. A second bedroom, a compact study nook and a modernised tiled bathroom make good use of the space.\r\nYou're handy to Red Beach's shops, schools and coastline, with Orewa's cafés, Silverdale Shopping Centre and motorway access all within easy reach. It's an appealing spot to downsize or buy your first home, with room to enjoy the outdoors and a location that makes everyday errands easy.\r\nThe vendor is ready to make her move south. Call Chris or Sue to arrange your viewing.",
